  <h2>11. Conclusion</h2>
  <p>
    The Grand Vista Hotel Reservation System demonstrates a complete hotel management workflow using core Java web technologies.
    It includes multiple modules, role-based access, file-based persistence, and OOP design patterns across the model layer.
    With further enhancements such as database integration and automated testing, the project can be extended for real-world use.
  </p>

